OL,3,GNEWSAResidents 'upset' over landfill
OL,4,Asite controlled burn
OL,5,
OL,6,FSmoke from a fire at a landfill site
OL,7,Fthat is being managed using controlled
OL,8,Fburning has left nearby residents
OL,9,F"stressed and upset".
OL,11,FOxfordshire Fire and Rescue said it was
OL,12,Ffirst called to the fire at Appleford
OL,13,FSidings, in Sutton Courtenay, near
OL,14,FDidcot, on 14 September.
OL,16,FA statement issued by the organisations
OL,17,Finvolved in the tackling the blaze said
OL,18,Fthe "safest and most appropriate way"
OL,19,Fto manage the fire was with controlled
OL,20,Fburning.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
